      "message": "Merge 06a194c (main) into issue/230-snug-cylinder\n\nResolves the StockFit handler in ui/src/state.rs: keeps main's\napply_stock_fit flow and feeds it the snug cylinder fit\n(model::solid_world_radius_about, then stock::fit_cylinder_about; a None\nstill refuses with \"stock fit refused: models have no usable extent\").\nMoves this PR's RECOMMENDED.md entry verbatim to\ndocs/decisions/230-snug-cylinder.md, taking main's RECOMMENDED.md.\n\nRefs #230\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
